  "description": "Lead and Participate in the 2019 Global BlueHack as a team member to create a value solutions focused on Digital Transformation, Business Growth or Optimization (Be an Active Practitioner of Value Creation)",
  "problemStatement": "IBM Services needs to refresh it's portfolio of long terms services centered in digital transformation, migration to cloud and value industry solutions. This initiative focus on the opportunity for IBMers, as a team, to take time to use their experience and skills to create the value propositions and scenarios we IBM so direly need to showcase to our clients. \r\n                                                                                                                                                                ",
  "outcome": "BlueHack outcomes are documented and have: Clear value proposition, Minimum viable prototype, Business model, Business Pitch, are peer and SME evaluated and classified. The best ones are intended to become part of focus client pursuits to become IBM offerings.",
  "finalOutcome": "We have trained 1850+ GTSers in the co-creation of business value propositions during the all GTS NA & WW Bootcamp as well as GTS-Open BlueHack. This activity focused on client value generation thought short cloud concept storylines. According to GTS-Global the Bootcamps result generated more than 1.5B in the opportunity pipeline for GTS. Our metrics indicate we've generated 300+ use-case concepts for clients.",
